OL,3,GNEWSAJohnny Marr guitars sell for more
OL,4,Athan #560k at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo guitars owned by Manchester
OL,7,Fmusician Johnny Marr have sold for more
OL,8,Fthan #560,000 at auction.
OL,10,FThe instruments, which were used during
OL,11,Fhis time with The Smiths and on his
OL,12,Fforthcoming solo album, went under the
OL,13,Fhammer as part of Christie's Marr's
OL,14,FGuitars: The Johnny Marr Collection
OL,15,Fsale.
OL,17,FMarr's 1982 Rickenbacker 330 Jetglo
OL,18,Fsold for #358,400 after attracting a
OL,19,Fbidding battle lasting more than five
OL,20,Fminutes.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
