OL,3,GNEWSAJohnny Marr guitars sell for more
OL,4,Athan #560k at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe guitar was used throughout the
OL,7,Frecording of The Smiths' debut album
OL,8,Fand on the band's early tours. It can
OL,9,Fbe heard on songs including This
OL,10,FCharming Man, Still Ill and What
OL,11,FDifference Does It Make? The instrument
OL,12,Falso featured on the cover of Oasis's
OL,13,Fdebut single Supersonic.
